// Conformance fixture for ta.atr (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.23, Wave 5B-3).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's ATR formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic OHLC series (see ta_atr.csv `high`/`low`/`close`).
// ATR = rma(tr(handle_na=true), length); Wilder's seed = SMA of first
// `length` valid TR values, then alpha=1/length recursion. Because
// handle_na=true is passed internally by ta.atr, the first bar's TR
// is (high-low) rather than NA, so the seed forms at bar `length-1`.
// With length=3 the first ATR value lands at bar index 2 (bar 3 of 10).
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_atr", overlay=false)
plot(ta.atr(3), title="atr3")
